<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">KOLOSEFOƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosefoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">KOLOSEFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">ƆFA MANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">KOLOSEFOƐ</para>
  <para style="ip">Somafoɛ Paul hworɔle krataa he mane Kristofoɛ bɔ ne bɛte Kolose kuro nanu ne. Ɔhworɔle krataa he ne Efesofoɛ ne Filipifoɛ deɛ namukoraati kɔyɛ afoɛ 60-61 Y.A,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> sɔ mmerɛ ne, né baha ye bawura awuro wɔ Roman. Onesimus ne Tikiko yeɛ bɛfale sɔ ngrataa nza mukoraati bɛhɔle ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul maa bɛnwuni tumi bɔ Kristo le ye wɔ abɔdeɛ mukoraati nu, na ɔhane kyɛ Kristo te abɔdeɛ mukoraati nu piesie, na ɔnate ye mogya naso yeɛ wasiesie mmenia ne Nyameɛ afia ɔ. Paul sa hane kyɛ, odikyɛ yɛfa y'adwene yɛsie nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro naso, na ɔtte nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ ase ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Afei koso, né ebiemɔ fa ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ bɛwura Kristofoɛ asafo nanu, yeti Paul bɔle bɛ kɔkɔ wɔ ye nwo, na osa hyɛle bɛ nguraen kyɛ, bɛyere bɛ nwo, na bɛma bɛ nwo kokwa wɔ Kristo nu. Mmerɛ bɔ Paul maa bɛnwuni Kristo nwo nningyein pee ne, né ɔboka bɛ maa bɛpo ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ, Yudafoɛ amammerɛ, ne abɔfo bɔ bɛsõ bɛ ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul sa hyɛle bɛ nguraen kyɛ bɛho betia bɔne, bɛyere bɛ nwo bɛyɛ krongron, na bɛwura suban foforɛ ne.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:3-8">1:3-8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo ne ye adwuma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:9-2:19">1:9–2:19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bra foforɛ bɔ odikyɛ yɛbɔ ye wɔ Kristo nu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:2-4:6">2:2–4:6</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Me Paul, bɔ Nyameɛ adaworoma nde Kristo Yesu somafoɛ, mene yɛliema Timoteo,<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />yɛfa krataa he yɛkɔma akrongronfoɛ ne aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛdi nahorɛ wɔ Kristo nu wɔ Kolose ne:</para>
  <para style="m" vid="COL 1:2">Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ berɛ ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Mmerɛ biala bɔ yɛkɔbɔ mbaeɛ yɛkɔma ɛmɔne, yɛda Nyameɛ, y'Awurade Yesu Kristo Baba ne ase, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />ofikyɛ yate gyidie bɔ ɛmɔle ye wɔ Kristo Yesu nu, ɔne kyɛbɔ ɛmɔdɔ akrongronfoɛ nanwo dwirɛ, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />anidasoɛ bɔ ɔla berɛ ma ɛmɔ wɔ anwuro nati yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ sɔ ne. Ɛmɔtele anidasoɛ he anwo dwirɛ, mmerɛ bɔ bɛfale nahorɛ bɔ ɔfa nzɛmba nanwo ne <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />bɛbrɛle ɛmɔ ne. Na kyɛbɔ nzɛmba ne nyi na osu mmaa wɔ wiase mukoraati ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ofi kyẽa bɔ ɛmɔ tele na ɛmɔ nwuni bɔ Nyameɛ adom ne kyire deinn ne, ɔyɛ wɔ ɛmɔ nu ɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Ɛhe yeɛ ɛmɔsua bɛfili Epafra bɔ ɔte yɛ mmango akoaa bɔ yɛdɔ ye ne berɛ ne. Ɔte Kristo somvoɛ bɔ odi nahorɛ, bɔ ósi yɛ gya nu yɛ adwuma ɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Na ye yeɛ ɔhane ɔdɔ bɔ honhom ne amaa ɛmɔ anya ye nanwo dwirɛ hyirele yɛ ne.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Ɛhe ati, ofi kyẽa bɔ yɛtele ye nwo dwirɛ ne, daa biala yɛbɔ mbaeɛ yɛma ɛmɔ, na yɛsrɛ kyɛ ɔma<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ Nyameɛ </char></note> ɛmɔnya ye apɛdeɛ nwo nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu, na ɛmɔnya nyanza ne honhom nu ndeaseɛ mukoraati bie, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ kɔnate atee pa so wɔ Awurade nyunu, na ɛmɔ asɔ ye nye wɔ nikye biala nu, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔsu mmaa wɔ adwuma pa biala nu, na ɛmɔnya Nyameɛ nwo nahorɛ nimdeɛ pee ne. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Yesa yɛsrɛ kyɛ, kyɛbɔ ye anuonyam tumi ne te ne, ɔma ɛmɔ anwoserɛ pee, ná wamaa ɛmɔ ahora bagyina nu baadwu awieɛ wɔ aboterɛ ne anigye nu, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔda Baba ne ase kyɛ wamaa ɛmɔ afata, kyɛ ɛmɔ konya agyapadeɛ bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ ma akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ kanea nu nanu kyɛfa ne. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Walɛ yɛ wafi awosii tumi bo, na wafa yɛ wawa Ɔwa bɔ ɔdɔ ye né ahennie nu, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />ɔnate ye so yeɛ balɛ́ yɛ, kyire kyɛ, bafa yɛ bɔne bahyɛ yɛ.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Ye yeɛ ɔte Nyameɛ bɔ anyeɛ nnwu ye ne sɛso,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa: “Suban so.”</char></note> abɔdeɛ mukoraati nu piesie, <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />ofikyɛ bɛnate ye so yeɛ bɛbɔle nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne aseɛ so; bɔ anyeɛ nwu ye, ɔne bɔ anyeɛ nnwu ye, ahennie, atumvoɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Awura mɔ.”</char></note> awaen, ne tumidie. Bɛnate ye so yeɛ bɛbɔle nningyein bɔ waha namukoraati, na bɛbɔ bɛmane ye. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Afei koso, né ɔwɔ berɛ kora yeɛ nningyein bɔ waha namukoraati ba ɔ, na bɛnate ye so yeɛ bɛyɛle nningyein bɔ waha namukoraati ɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Ye yeɛ ɔte nipadua ne ti, kyire kyɛ asafo ne ti ɔ. Ye yeɛ ole ahyɛaseɛ ne, na ye yeɛ bɛli moa bɛtingyele ye bɛfili ewue nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, okoli moa wɔ nikye biala nu. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Ofikyɛ né ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye kyɛ ɔkɔmaa Ɔwa ne koli mu koraa, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />na ɔnate ye so aha nningyein mukoraati abɔnu bieku, kyire kyɛ, ɔnate ye mogya bɔ ohwie guale wɔ asɛnnua naso ne aha nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ he aso ne bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro namukoraati abɔnu bieku, na wamaa asomdwie awa Nyameɛ ne bɛ afia.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Mmerɛ bie bɔ wapɛ nu ne, né ɛmɔ ahwe ɛmɔ nwo koraa bafi Nyameɛ nwo, né ɛmɔte ye atamfo, ofikyɛ bɔne ngome yeɛ ne ɛmɔ adwene wɔ so ɔ, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />nakoso kesaalae de, ɔnate Kristo bɔ owuli ne nipadua naso aha ɛmɔ ne ye abɔnu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔkɔfa ɛmɔ kɔma Nyameɛ kyɛ mmenia krongron bɔ dɛm ne edwirɛ biala nne bɛ nwo. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Nakoso, sana ɛmɔkɔ so bɛtena gyidie nanu, na ɛmɔgyina pindinn wɔ fapem naso, bɔ ɛmɔngɔma nikye fee ngɔhwe ɛmɔ ngɔfi anidasoɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nate nzɛmba naso anya ye nanwo, sɔ nzɛmba ne yeɛ baha ye nwo dwirɛ bahyire abɔdeɛ bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro bo namukoraati ne, na ɛhe yeɛ me Paul, maayɛ ye nwo somvoɛ ne.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Kesaalae ɛmɔ ti, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ menwu amaneɛ, nakoso medi ahurusi, na menwu ye kyɛ, ɔnate kyɛ mmoka Kristo nipadua naso, kyire kyɛ asafo naso nati, amaneɛ bɔ odikyɛ menwu ye ne, waha kaa. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Nyameɛ afa awura me sa kyɛ nzo asafo he, na ɛmɔ ti, bafa bawura me sa kyɛ nga Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne ma ebiala te, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />edwirɛ krongron bɔ ɔfa feale tete wiase ne, ɔne aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ bɔ wapɛ nu ne. Nakoso, kesaalae de, wala ye ali wahyire akrongronfoɛ nemɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Akrongronfoɛ ne de, Nyameɛ nye gye ye nwo kyɛ ɔkɔmaa bɛkonwu edwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea né anuonyam bɔ olle ye noa, bɔ wala ye ali wahyire maen-maen ne. Ye yeɛ ole Kristo bɔ ɛmɔ ne ye ayɛ kõ ne, na ɛmɔle anidasoɛ kyɛ, bɛkɔhyɛ ɛmɔ ne ye mukoraati anuonyam ne. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Ye yeɛ yɛbɔ ye nwo dawure, yɛtu ebiala fo, na yɛfa nyanza bɔ ɔkɔ siɛ yɛkyirekyire ebiala, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yɛkɔfa ebiala bɔ ɔne Kristo ayɛ kõ ne yɛkɔwa Nyameɛ nyunu kyɛ ebie bɔ odi mu. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Na ɛhe anwo yeɛ meyɛ adwuma serɛ ne, na ɔnate ye tumi bɔ ɔyɛ adwuma wɔ me nu paa nati, me yere me nwo.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Na mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu mmɔden paa bɔ mebɔ mema ɛmɔ ne bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Laodikea ne, ɔne bɛ bɔ nnwuni bɛ nyunu lle ne. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a b'ahone kɔtɔ bɛ kunu, bɛkɔyɛ kõ wɔ ɔdɔ nu, na ndeaseɛ bɔ odi mu bɔ banya ye nati, banya mvasoɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bekonya Nyameɛ dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea nanwo nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu, bɔ yeɛ ole Kristo ne. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Ye nu yeɛ bafa nyanza ne nimdeɛ bɔ ɔsom bo mukoraati bafea ɔ. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Meka ɛhe, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ebiala ngɔfa edwirɛ biala ngɔlaka-laka ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Ɔwɔ nu, nne berɛ anwoɔnaen nu, nakoso, nwɔ berɛ honhom nu, na ɔyɛ me fɛ kyɛ ɛmɔ toto nningyein yé, na ɛmɔ anya gyidie bɔ enu yɛ se wɔ Kristo nu ɔ.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Yeti, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ alɛ́ Awurade Kristo Yesu bato nu ne, ɛmɔhɔ so bɛ ne ye nate, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />ɛmɔma bɛto ɛmɔ besie ye so, ná ɛmɔtira ndii, ɛmɔgyina pindinn wɔ gyidie nanu kyɛbɔ bahyirehyire ɛmɔ ne, na ɛmɔla Nyameɛ ase daa.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Ɛmɔnea yé, ná ebie amva wiase nyanza ne edwirɛ mbaen bɔ oggyi Kristo so, na mmom ogyi sona atetesɛm ne nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ wiase nanu naso anlaka-laka ɛmɔ; <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />ofikyɛ Kristo nu yeɛ Nyameɛ suban mukoraati di mu ɔ. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Yeti, ɛmɔ nate Kristo bɔ ɔte awaen ne tumidie mukoraati ti naso ali mu. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Ye bɔ ɛmɔ ne ye fale adamvoa ne yeɛ wamaa bapɛ ɛmɔ toa, nná asaa yeɛ bɛfa bɛpɛle ɔ, mmom Kristo nu yeɛ bɛpɛle ɛmɔ toa bɛyele anwoɔnaen nipadua ne bɛfili berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Na mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ bɔle asu ne, besiele ɛmɔ bɛbokale ye so, na bɛtingyele ye ne ɛmɔ bɛbɔle nu, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ nyane gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ nyumaa mbiri-mbiri nanu, ye yeɛ otingyele Kristo fili ewue nu ne.<verse eid="COL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Mmerɛ bie, ɔnate ɛmɔ mvomsoɛ ne ɛmɔ nipadua bɔ ne ɛmɔpɛlle ye toa nati, né ɛmɔ awu, nakoso, Nyameɛ maa ɛmɔ ne Kristo wale ngoa nu. Ɔlole yɛ fale yɛ mvomsoɛ mukoraati hyɛle yɛ, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />na mmeraa bɔ bɛfale bɛ sa bɛhworɔle,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Asaanoa ndworɔyɛ.”</char></note> bɔ ahyɛdeɛ wɔ nu, ná ɔkõ tia yɛ ne, okyikyi fili berɛ. Ɔye fili berɛ fa bɔle asɛnnua nanu. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Na mmerɛ bɔ ɔpale awaen ne tumidie ahoroɛ nanwo tena ne, oguale bɛ nyunu ase wɔ badwanu, na ɔnate asɛnnua naso amaa ebiala anwu ye kyɛ wali bɛ so ngunim.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Yeti, nnɛmɔ maa ebiala bu ɛmɔ atɛn wɔ bɔ ɛmɔ koli, bɔ ɛmɔ kɔno, afahyɛ, ɛsraen foforɛ, anaa homeda nwo. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Né ɛhemɔ te nningyein bɔ ɔba né wawoɛ, na nipadua<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa: “Nikye.”</char></note> ne deinn yeɛ ole Kristo. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Yeti, nnɛmɔ maa ebiala yɛ maa ɛmɔ akatua ne bɔ ɛmɔ, ebie bɔ ɔhyɛda yɛ ye nwo kyɛ ɔbrɛ ye nwo ase, okuro ɔsom bɔ bɛfa bɛma abɔfo, ná bɔ onwu ye ngome yeɛ odɛ́ gyina nu ne. Ɔnate kyɛ anwoɔnaen nu yeɛ ɔdwene nningyein nwo nati, ɔma ye nwo so bɔ ndeaseɛ biala nne nu. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Wahwe ye nwo wafi tire nanwo, tire bɔ nipadua namukoraati nate ye so nya bɔ ohia, ná akwaa namukoraati nate ye ndii naso aha atoa nu ayɛ kõ ne. Na tire ne yeɛ ɔmaa nipadua ne nyi, kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ pena kyɛ onyi ne.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Sɛ ɛmɔ ne Kristo awu wɔ wiase nanu nningyein bɔ mvasoɛ nne so nanu a, ye de, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɛmɔ nikye te kyɛ ɛmɔtɛ́ wɔ wiase, na ɛmɔfa ahyɛdeɛ ahoroɛ bɛto ɛmɔ nwo so bieku kyɛ: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Nnɛsɔ nu,” “nnɛka nea,” na “nnɛfa wɔ sa ka ye” ne? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Sɔ nningyein ne, sɛ bɛfa bɛdi dwumaa beyie a, né wasɛkye, ofikyɛ, ogyi sona ahyɛdeɛ ne ngyerɛkyerɛ so. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Sɔ nningyein namukoraati, annea a, ɛkɔha kyɛ mvasoɛ wɔ so, nakoso ɔte bɛ som nu nningyein bɔ ɔmaa bɛ pati bɛbrɛ bɛ nwo ase, na ɔmaa bɛhyɛ bɛ nipadua ne anyeborolɛ; nakoso mvasoɛ nne so, na ɔngora nzi anwoɔnaen akɔnnɔ atee.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Yeti, ɔnate kyɛ bɛtingye ɛmɔ ne Kristo nati, ɛmɔpena nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne, nekaa bɔ Yesu te Nyameɛ sa famaa so ne. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ adwene besie nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro naso, nná nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ he aso ne. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Ofikyɛ ɛmɔ wuli, na bafa ɛmɔ ngoa bama Kristo wɔ Nyameɛ nu. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Sɛ bɛda Kristo bɔ ɔte yɛ ngoa ne ali a, ɛmɔ koso, bɛkɔla ɛmɔ ne ye ali wɔ anuonyam nu.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Yeti, ɛmɔhu ɛmɔ nipadua akwaa bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ he aso ne wɔ adwamammɔ, bra-bɔne, nnaa nwo akɔnnɔ bɔ yenoa yɛ se, akɔnnɔ bɔne, ɔne anyeborolɛ bɔ ɔte abosonsom nwo. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Ofikyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ ati yeɛ Nyameɛ yaa ba bɛ bɔ bɛ so yɛ se naso ne. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Mmerɛ bie bɔ wapɛ nu ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ bɔle ɛmɔ bra ɔ. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Nakoso kesaalae de, ɛmɔgyi nningyein he amukoraati bɛgua: ahone tɛɛ, ɛyaa, nningyein tɛɛ, alapaa, na nnɛmɔ maa edwirɛ bɔ ye nwo nde fi ɛmɔ noa nu fite. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Nnɛmɔ pɛ anoanu bɛkyire ɛmɔ nwo, mmom ɛmɔye suban daa ne bɛgua, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />na ɛmɔwura suban foforɛ bɔ bɛnate nahorɛ nimdeɛ so bɛyɛ ye foforɛ, maa osoma bɔ ɔbɔle né suban ne. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Ɔba sɔ a, Greekniɛ anaa Yudaniɛ nne berɛ, bɔ bapɛ ye toa anaa bɔ bɛpɛlle ye toa nne berɛ, Skiteniɛ anaa ɛwɔfoɛ nne berɛ, akoaa anaa dehyeɛ nne berɛ, ofikyɛ Kristo yeɛ ɔte nikye biala, na ɔne yɛ mukoraati ayɛ kõ ɔ.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Yeti, mmenia bɔ Nyameɛ aye ɛmɔ, akrongronfoɛ ne adɔfo, ɛmɔfa ahunu-ndetelɛ, paayɛlɛ, anwobraseɛ, honhom bɔ odwo, ɔne aboterɛ bɛyɛ atadeɛ bɛwura. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Sɛ ebie ne ye mmango le edwirɛ a, ɛmɔhɔ so benya ɛmɔ nwo aboterɛ, na ɛmɔfa bɛhyɛ ɛmɔ nwo koraa, kyɛbɔ Awurade fa ɛmɔ bɔne kyɛ ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Ye mukoraati si ne, ɛmɔwura ɔdɔ kyɛ atadeɛ, ofikyɛ ɔka nningyein bɔnu maa odi mu. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Afei, ɛmɔma Kristo asomdwie ne li ɛmɔ ahone so, ofikyɛ ɛhe ati yeɛ bɛfrɛle ɛmɔ bɛwale nipadua kõ nu ne. Na nnɛmɔyɛ bonniayɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Ɛmɔma Kristo dwirɛ ne bu so wɔ ɛmɔ nu, na wamaa ɛmɔ anya nyanza pee. Ɛmɔfa edwein, ayɛyie, ne honhom nu dwein bɔ bɛfa anisɔ bɛto ye b'ahone nu bɛye Awurade ayɛ, behyirehyire ɛmɔ nwo, ná ɛmɔ hyehyɛ ɛmɔ nwo nguraen. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Na nikye biala bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne, kyɛ ɔte dwudwolɛ anaa nneyɛɛ ne, ɛmɔyɛ ye mukoraati wɔ Awurade Yesu dumaa nu, na ɛmɔfa ye so bɛla Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte Baba ne ase.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Mmrasua bɔ ɛmɔ agya ne, ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase bɛma bɛ humɔ, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔyɛ bɛma Awurade ne.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Na mmrienzua koso, ɛmɔhɔ so bɛlɔ bɛ yemɔ, na nnɛmɔ fɛ bɛ so yaa serɛ-serɛ.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Ngwalaa, ɛmɔtie ɛmɔ awofo dwirɛ wɔ nikye biala nu, na ɛhe yeɛ ɔsɔ Awurade nye ɔ.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Baba mɔ, nnɛmɔ hyɛ ngwalaa nemɔ anyeborolɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa: “Nnɛmɔyɛ bɛ nikye bɔ ɔkɔmaa bɛkɔfɛ yaa ɔ.”</char></note> wanyɛ sɔ a, b'abanu kobu.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Ngoaa koso, ɛmɔtie ɛmɔ wuramɔ bɔ bɛte mmenia ne wɔ nikye biala nu, nná mmerɛ bɔ bɛnwu bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne ngome, ná wanyɛ kyɛ ɛmɔsɔ sona nye, mmom ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛyɛ ye kyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛsuro Awurade. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Nikye biala bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne, ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛyɛ ye kyɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɛma Awurade, na ɔtte sona, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />ofikyɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ agyapadeɛ bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkotua ɛmɔ kerɛ ne, ofi Awurade berɛ. Ɛmɔyɛ ngoaa bɛma yɛ Wura Kristo. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔkɔyɛ bɔne ne, okonya ye bɔne nanwo akatua, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ nnea sona nyunu.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Awura mɔ, ɛmɔ ne ɛmɔ ngoaa nemɔ li ye wɔ atee bɔ ɔtengyɛ na ɔfata so, na ɛmɔkaye kyɛ ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔ Wura wɔ anwuro.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Ɛmɔyere ɛmɔ nwo bɛbɔ mbaeɛ, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ wɔ mbaebɔ nu, na ɛmɔla ase. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Afei koso, ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma yɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, Nyameɛ kobukye atee bie kɔma yɛ, na yahora yaha Kristo nwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea ne, na ɛhene ati yeɛ bafa kyenyi bakyekye me bato prizin ne. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma me, na wamaa mahora maha ye yé, kyɛbɔ odikyɛ meka ne.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Bɛ bɔ bɛ bokka yɛ so ne, ɛmɔ ne bɛ li ye yé, na ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ mmerɛ beli dwumaa yé. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ noa nu dwirɛ yɛ fɛ daa biala, na ngyee bra nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ konwu edwirɛ bɔ ɛmɔkɔha bɛkohyire ebiala ɔ.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tikiko te nniema bɔ medɔ ye, ɔba a, ɔkɔha me nwo dwirɛ mukoraati kohyire ɛmɔ. Ɔte somvoɛ bɔ odi nahorɛ, na ɔte me mmango akoaa wɔ Awurade nu. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Mesoma ye meba ɛmɔ berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ konwu kyɛbɔ yɛ nwo te ɔ, na wasa wahyɛ ɛmɔ nguraen. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Ɔne Onesimus yeɛ bɛkɔwa ɔ, ye koso ɔte nniema bɔ medɔ ye, na odi nahorɛ, bɛkɔha bɔ ɔkɔso wɔ ɛwa namukoraati bɛkohyire ɛmɔ.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristarko bɔ mene ye la prizin ne nwa ɔkyea ɛmɔ, na Barnaba abusuaniɛ Marko koso nwa ɔkyea ɛmɔ (ye yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɔba ɛmɔ berɛ a, ɛmɔle ye ne), <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />ɔne Yesu bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yusto ne. Ɛhemɔ ala yeɛ bɛte Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛne me yɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo adwuma ɔ, na bamaa m'ahone atɔ me kunu paa. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafra, Yesu Kristo akoaa bɔ ofi ɛmɔ berɛ ne nwa ɔkyea ɛmɔ. Daa biala, ɔyere ye nwo bɔ mbaeɛ ma ɛmɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ kogyina pindinn, na ɛmɔ adwene asi ɛmɔ pi wɔ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro mukoraati nu. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Medi ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ, ɔyɛ bɔ ɔkɔhora biala boka ɛmɔ ne bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Laodikea ne Hierapoli ne. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luka bɔ ɔte yɛ dɔfo dɔktaniɛ ne, ɔne Dema nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Ɛmɔhyea aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ Laodikea ne bɛma me, na ɛmɔhyea Nimfa ne asafo bɔ beyia nu wɔ ye awuro berɛ ne bɛma me. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Sɛ ɛmɔkenga krataa he wɔ ɛmɔ berɛ beyie a, ɛmɔma bɛkenga ye wɔ Laodikea asafo nanu, na ɛmɔle bɛ deɛ ne koso bɛkenga. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Afei, ɛmɔha behyire Arkipo kyɛ: “Ɔsom adwuma bɔ ɛlɛle ye wɔ Awurade nu ne, yere wɔ nwo yɛ ye yé.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Paul, me bɔbɔ me sa yeɛ mva ndworɔle ngyeaa he ɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Ɛmɔkaye kyenyi bɔ bafa bakyekye me bato prizin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Adom ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>